60 S.D.C.) - and the same line is the NSB Agent''s on printed 201. The chapter sells no ''Beretta 95''; the Model 951R Semi P Full Auto Beretta (printed 212, 2D6, full auto) is the nearest and is cited, though its magazine is 10 rounds against the 20 the entry prints. The M-16 is the 5.56mm M16 & M16A1 row (printed 216). The armor is Hard Armor (printed 223), the chapter''s only A.R. 16 / 260 S.D.C. suit. MONEY: the entry prints none. NIGHTBANES'' SKINS, the artifact capes a few elite agents are given, are in GM Notes: fewer than 20 exist and all are Moloch''s."
